+- `--threshold <metric>=<value>` – set a minimum score threshold for a metric (e.g., `--threshold exact_match=0.9`). Can be used multiple times. Exits with code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass (or none specified). Code 2 on validation errors (malformed threshold or unknown metric).
 
